FreeSiege: controls
===================

Two players at one keyboard (Options, then Keys, changes them; they are
kept in the drawer's User drawer):

               Player 1      Player 2
  Up           Cursor up     E
  Left         Cursor left   S
  Down         Cursor down   D
  Right        Cursor right  F
  Select/Swap  O             Q
  Validate     P             W

Swap blocks to build the patterns ("Patterns" in the menu shows them),
then validate to send the unit at the other castle. A joystick or gamepad
works too (directions, buttons A and B).
